    {
      "id": "q0_profile",
      "type": "custom",
      "position": {
        "x": 100,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "header": "CANDIDATE PROFILE",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "content": "100,000 Came to the Great Intake, already 22,000 are gone. \n\nDid you pay enough attention in class to stay in the hunt? Or will you be sent back home?",
            "type": "text",
            "variant": "danger"
          },
          {
            "content": "Which of the remaining candidates are you?",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "ports": [
          {
            "id": "profile_britt",
            "meta": 100,
            "subtext": "Though she is interested in what skills and growth the academy can offer her, Britt is attending in pursuit of finding answers to lingering suspicions and questions about Harmony and its relationship to her clan. She is outspoken, tough, and diligent.",
            "scores": {
              "GOLD": 2,
              "Initial Gold": 1,
              "BRITT": 1
            },
            "nextId": "79cc0765-2479-43fa-be2d-33142de796eb",
            "text": "Britt "
          },
          {
            "scores": {
              "IGGY": 1,
              "GOLD": 2,
              "Initial Gold": 1
            },
            "subtext": "Iggy walks around muttering through theories that make sense only to him. Life on the surface has left him constantly ill—and perpetually grumpy about sunlight, wind, and anything that moves",
            "meta": 100,
            "id": "profile_iggy",
            "nextId": "79cc0765-2479-43fa-be2d-33142de796eb",
            "text": "Iggy"
          },
          {
            "id": "profile_aggie",
            "meta": 85,
            "subtext": "Quieter than her cousin, but just as skeptical and suspicious of Harmony and \"civilization\". Eager to build on her knowledge of poison so she can hopefully help the forest regain it's balance of life and death.",
            "scores": {
              "AGGIE": 1,
              "SILVER": 2,
              "Initial Silver": 1
            },
            "nextId": "79cc0765-2479-43fa-be2d-33142de796eb",
            "text": "Aggie"
          },
          {
            "scores": {
              "IGNATIUS": 1,
              "SILVER": 2,
              "Initial Silver": 1
            },
            "subtext": "An Emberkin from the Ash Blood clan. A young upstart who seeks a new magma heart for the clan. While he does not hate the empire of Harmony, he hates the dependence on harmony and feels they can not be called equals until the relationship is built upon mutual trade and respect. His beliefs have caused  a stir back on his islands so he fled to the mainland to become an adventurer to find a new source of heat for his people while rising in the ranks as an adventurer.",
            "meta": 85,
            "id": "profile_ignatius",
            "nextId": "79cc0765-2479-43fa-be2d-33142de796eb",
            "text": "Ignatius"
          },
          {
            "nextId": "79cc0765-2479-43fa-be2d-33142de796eb",
            "text": "Loami",
            "meta": 70,
            "id": "profile_loami",
            "subtext": "Human/Earthkin Guardian\nFrom a long line of proud boiler workers Loami worked at the academy through an exploratory lull, but with new horizons to explore he leaves the boilers behind to forge a new family legacy!",
            "scores": {
              "COPPER": 2,
              "LOAMI": 1,
              "Initial Copper": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
