            "title": "The Z-Axis Paradox",
            "type": "header"
          },
          {
            "content": "A floating island is rotating at 45 degrees per minute. A 'Solar Gale' is blowing against the rotation. The manual suggests a Synchronized Helix, but your ship’s solar sails are at 90% stress.",
